Sat Aug  1 10:21:45 UTC 2026 - Jan Engelhardt <jengelh@inai.de>

- Update to release 1.4
  * Dropped the dependency on the `GAPDoc` package, which was only
    needed for building the manual.
  * The test suite no longer requires the `SmallGrp` package.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Oct 17 11:46:24 UTC 2025 - Jan Engelhardt <jengelh@inai.de>

- Update to release 1.3
  * Set power maps in the character tables whose irreducibles have
    been computed by the `Irr` method that calls `IrrUnger`.
  * In the `Irr` method that calls `IrrUnger`, delegate to
    `IrrBaumClausen` if the group is abelian-by-supersolvable; this
    is usually faster.

